{
  "sn22.63:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.63 ",
  "sn22.63:0.2": "7. Arahantavagga ",
  "sn22.63:0.3": "Upādiyamānasutta ",
  "sn22.63:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn22.63:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn22.63:1.3": "Atha kho aññataro bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.63:1.4": "“sādhu me, bhante, bhagavā saṅkhittena dhammaṁ desetu yamahaṁ bhagavato dhammaṁ sutvā eko vūpakaṭṭho appamatto ātāpī pahitatto vihareyyan”ti. ",
  "sn22.63:1.5": "“Upādiyamāno kho, bhikkhu, baddho mārassa; ",
  "sn22.63:1.6": "anupādiyamāno mutto pāpimato”ti. ",
  "sn22.63:1.7": "“Aññātaṁ bhagavā, aññātaṁ sugatā”ti. ",
  "sn22.63:2.1": "“Yathā kathaṁ pana tvaṁ, bhikkhu, mayā saṅkhittena bhāsitassa vitthārena atthaṁ ājānāsī”ti? ",
  "sn22.63:2.2": "“Rūpaṁ kho, bhante, upādiyamāno baddho mārassa; ",
  "sn22.63:2.3": "anupādiyamāno mutto pāpimato. ",
  "sn22.63:2.4": "Vedanaṁ upādiyamāno baddho mārassa; ",
  "sn22.63:2.5": "anupādiyamāno mutto pāpimato. ",
  "sn22.63:2.6": "Saññaṁ … ",
  "sn22.63:2.7": "saṅkhāre … ",
  "sn22.63:2.8": "viññāṇaṁ upādiyamāno baddho mārassa; ",
  "sn22.63:2.9": "anupādiyamāno mutto pāpimato. ",
  "sn22.63:2.10": "Imassa khvāhaṁ, bhante, bhagavatā saṅkhittena bhāsitassa evaṁ